<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderately heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 47.71 to 5969.38.</p>
<p>For the week, the Dow fell 23.48.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.54 to 372.89.</p>
<p>For the week, the composite fell 1.27.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.27.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1433 to 864.</p>
<p>Volume was 395,922,828 versus 394,950,750 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Volume for the week was 2,016,722,820.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
